<!-- SAMARBETSMODELLER -->
<section class="section" id="modeller">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Engagement models</p>
      <h2>Step-by-step progression</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">We build the partnership in three clear phases. Our role is never to sell the product on your behalf, but to navigate the buying process and put you in the right room with the right decision-makers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid two">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="card-badge">Intro level</span>
        <h3>Enterprise Opportunity Assessment Snapshot</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">A short, exclusive, risk-free assessment by invitation.</p>
        <p class="card-desc">We map a handful of key accounts in a selected segment, analyse the hidden potential and present a high-level strategy for reaching them.</p>
        <p class="card-outcome"><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Companies that want to evaluate the opportunity before a full engagement.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="card-badge">Phase 1</span>
        <h3>Enterprise Opportunity Assessment</h3>
        <p class="card-desc"><strong>Focus:</strong> Strategy, mapping &amp; action plan. The goal is to identify the fastest and most realistic path to new deals.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Prioritised markets and target accounts</li>
          <li>Identified decision-makers, buying groups and procurement officers</li>
          <li>Analysis of legal, technical and organisational barriers</li>
          <li>A concrete, agile plan for how deals will be created and developed</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="card-outcome"><strong>Outcome:</strong> A clear, executable path to your next major customer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="card-badge">Phase 2</span>
        <h3>Enterprise Deal Acceleration</h3>
        <p class="card-desc"><strong>Focus:</strong> Account engagement, first contact &amp; early momentum. We activate the strategy and build early customer relationships.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Engaging the identified target accounts</li>
          <li>Initiating qualified conversations</li>
          <li>Navigating decision-makers and early buyer barriers</li>
          <li>Partner strategies and adapting the message based on response</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="card-outcome"><strong>Outcome:</strong> More qualified opportunities and customer conversations that move forward.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="card-badge">Phase 3 · Long-term partnership</span>
        <h3>Enterprise Growth Partnership</h3>
        <p class="card-desc"><strong>Focus:</strong> Joint navigation, closing &amp; sales engine. For startups that want an active partner through the entire buying process up to a signed contract.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Hands-on support with public procurement, legal, GDPR and requirement specifications</li>
          <li>Pipeline management, commercial governance and strategic partnerships</li>
          <li>Active involvement all the way to closed deal</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="card-desc">We make sure the right decision-makers end up in the same room as your founder. We sit at the table, share the same goal and help steer the process home, while the founder sells the product itself and owns the customer relationship.</p>
        <p class="card-outcome"><strong>Outcome:</strong> A scalable, repeatable path from product-market fit to recurring enterprise revenue.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

